{"id":"n58250-1-5","stage":5,"title":"버럭 · 勃然","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58250-1-5-1","ko":"최 선생님이 화내니까 정말 무섭더라.","zh":"崔老师发火了，真的好可怕啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"최","meaning":"崔（姓氏）","explanation":"최：崔（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"최","audio":"/audio/432c9b1715e956c2c96a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"선생님이","meaning":"先生","explanation":"선생님：先生；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"2","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화내니까","meaning":"发火，生气","explanation":"화내다：发火，生气；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"화내다","audio":"/audio/6a08b78017242e5e9619.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87954","senseId":"1","lemma":"화내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무섭더라.","meaning":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","explanation":"무섭다：可怕，恐怖，畏惧；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"2","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"先生","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"加在某人的姓氏或职业之后，以表示对其的尊敬。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"6a08b78017242e5e","term":"화내다","zh":"发火，生气","audio":"/audio/6a08b78017242e5e9619.mp3","entryId":"87954","definition":"表现出心情非常不好，有怒气的感情。","pronunciation":["화ː내다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"难以面对或想逃避某个人或某种状况。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7ddc7df9094e65ede61e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58250-1-5-2","ko":"응. 평소에 조용하신 분이 버럭 소리를 지르시니까 나도 깜짝 놀랐어.","zh":"是啊，平时很安静的人突然大声吼叫，我也吓了一跳。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평소에","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조용하신","meaning":"文静","explanation":"조용하다：文静；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"조용하다","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58167","senseId":"2","lemma":"조용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분이","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버럭","meaning":"勃然","explanation":"버럭：勃然","readings":[{"term":"버럭","audio":"/audio/4ff9ab2c8db4d8079e55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58250","senseId":"1","lemma":"버럭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리를","meaning":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","explanation":"소리：嗓音，嗓子，嗓门；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"3","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지르시니까","meaning":"喊叫","explanation":"지르다：喊叫；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"지르다","audio":"/audio/987e83fdad67159dfb76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62312","senseId":"1","lemma":"지르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깜짝","meaning":"一惊","explanation":"깜짝：一惊","readings":[{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37744","senseId":"1","lemma":"깜짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀랐어.","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"ebf09ee6c46b848f","term":"평소","zh":"平常，平时，平日","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3","entryId":"71341","definition":"没有特别事情，通常的时候。","pronunciation":["평소"]},{"id":"1cd9dc985df28c49","term":"조용하다","zh":"文静","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3","entryId":"58167","definition":"寡言少语，行为斯文。","pronunciation":["조용하다"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"4ff9ab2c8db4d807","term":"버럭","zh":"勃然","audio":"/audio/4ff9ab2c8db4d8079e55.mp3","entryId":"58250","definition":"因非常不快而突然大吼或发火的样子。","pronunciation":["버럭"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"从人的喉咙发出的声音。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"987e83fdad67159d","term":"지르다","zh":"喊叫","audio":"/audio/987e83fdad67159dfb76.mp3","entryId":"62312","definition":"放开嗓音大叫。","pronunciation":["지르다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b47d1db3113dea64","term":"깜짝","zh":"一惊","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3","entryId":"37744","definition":"突然间受惊的样子。","pronunciation":["깜짝"]},{"id":"ca0d0655d175ea6c","term":"놀라다","zh":"惊吓，吃惊","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3","entryId":"61607","definition":"因遭到意外或害怕而在刹那间感到紧张或心跳加速。","pronunciation":["놀ː라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e9bf55ca985d4ccd27ff.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.533,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58250","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":171,"sequenceScore":3.3597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["崔老师发火了，真的好可怕啊。","是啊，平时很安静的人突然大声吼叫，我也吓了一跳。","哎呀！你到底去哪儿了，现在才出现啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["崔老师发火了，真的好可怕啊。","是啊，平时很安静的人突然大声吼叫，我也吓了一跳。","哎呀！你到底去哪儿了，现在才出现啊？"],"answer":1}]}
